00:44:22,500 --> 00:44:25,300
To give you an idea how bright, how loud, and so forth,

603
00:44:25,500 --> 00:44:28,940
3 million candle power is enough to constrict your pupils through closed eyelids.

604
00:44:29,400 --> 00:44:32,280
A headlight on bright is about 100,000 candle power.

605
00:44:33,380 --> 00:44:34,280
How loud?

606
00:44:34,281 --> 00:44:39,500
175 decibels is about four times as loud as a shotgun at the muzzle.

