00:54:09,860 --> 00:54:17,260
you don't have to now drop a 2,000-pound bomb to destroy the whole vehicle and the whole rocket launcher with all that collateral damage.

731
00:54:17,261 --> 00:54:22,960
If you can just precisely damage the right piece of that vehicle or that rocket, you've achieved the same thing.

732
00:54:22,961 --> 00:54:34,760
But the laser isn't the only device capable of non-lethal mission kill.

733
00:54:34,761 --> 00:54:38,840
Another high-tech weapon being developed for this purpose is the electromagnetic pulse

734
00:54:38,841 --> 00:54:39,840
munition.

