Border checkpoints, driveways, alleys and intersections and so forth.

766
00:57:46,960 --> 00:57:50,960
On the open roadway, a savvy driver might find a way to avoid the trap.

767
00:57:53,040 --> 00:57:58,100
What police really hope for is a sort of futuristic ray gun that could zap a fleeing vehicle,

768
00:57:58,660 --> 00:58:02,480
short out its electronics, and bring it to a stop under any circumstances.

769
00:58:03,200 --> 00:58:09,600
Scientists are working towards such a weapon, but at present, a serviceable prototype is

770
00:58:09,601 --> 00:58:14,480
still merely a distant goal.

